{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660100/extras/bff1da39815b574445e7c5eafd869743.avif?t=1748615737\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a European getaway filled with puzzles and hidden object challenges! The Collins family\u2019s trip to the Czech Republic sets the scene, but the real adventure lies in the variety of tasks waiting for you. Explore breathtaking locations inspired by real-world landmarks, uncover cleverly hidden objects, and solve a range of brain-teasing puzzles. From Prague\u2019s iconic Charles Bridge to charming hidden alleyways, every scene offers a new challenge for your attention and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an exciting collection of puzzles: from classic hidden object scenes to unique mini-games. Each scene is a new test of observation, memory, and problem-solving skills. Keep an eye out for special collectibles to enhance your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Dozens of unique mini-games and brain teasers to test your logic and observation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Extra content, including wallpapers and exclusive collectibles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Beautifully illustrated locations inspired by real-world Czech landmarks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Replayable puzzles \u2013 enjoy your favorite mini-games again and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Optional hint system \u2013 stuck on a tricky object? Use a hint to keep the adventure going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Immersive soundtrack and ambient sounds that bring each scene to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve every puzzle and uncover all the hidden secrets along the way? Get ready for a holiday full of surprises!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SCHEDULED VACATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/a0dca29285e6f22b8ea27e267b96496105451adc.jpg"},{"name":"ALMOST NATIVE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/aa7fb89dc03c8a88aee2d8833620f2090ad77474.jpg"},{"name":"RESEARCHER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/f621a9abbd8e4198dc942be1ced5be431ede0d43.jpg"},{"name":"LIKE CLOCKWORK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/beb2f3bcf4dc75c833179efedd1cd4d1f83daa6e.jpg"},{"name":"TREASURE HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/4d454d06b018e834f96a2d08dda88e16c8b6a5dc.jpg"},{"name":"WASN'T HARD WITH A MAP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/af5d1dfc8f6f80a83ba673e661c910e4fed76e7c.jpg"},{"name":"TREASURES OF BOHEMIA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/12616107300158bed899fb319ac9f3bd1f7a6e89.jpg"},{"name":"DIDN'T EVEN FLINCH...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/a5be823836cc487101f3523ffe2ff3e77d74c8a5.jpg"},{"name":"WHAT'S UP THERE?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/b4b2184cd536ab75a4e3e9774818e66bf216ee00.jpg"},{"name":"WHEN WILL IT BE DOWN?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660100/8b2dcefb7f7858951b10c5e207e2aa8c6b432a58.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660100?t=1748615737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660100?t=1748615737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660100/4abf74be0f163e6c2384dc8c93b5b659285fb244/ca